{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794669574761,"sessionID":"ses_e255ff46effe7EWyuOLOEwVdy1","part":{"partID":"prt_1daa477ab0015pI2K6hvbbYapb","sessionID":"ses_e255ff46effe7EWyuOLOEwVdy1","messageID":"msg_1daa454a0001bbKcFWt3ii130l","type":"tool","id":"call_e75b6d6a074e488aac652571","tool":"grep","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":".skilled","pattern":"_routes\\.yaml","limit":60},"output":"Found 60 matches\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/changelog/skilled/v3+/v3.4.1.0.md:\n  Line 368: Ten `/doctor:*` markdown commands collapsed to three: `/doctor <target>`, `/doctor:mcp` and `/doctor:update`. `/doctor:mcp` takes the `install` and `debug` sub-actions. The argv-positional router covers memory, causal-graph, code-graph, deep-loop, cocoindex, skill-advisor and skill-budget through `.opencode/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml`. `/doctor:update` is unchanged.\n\n  Line 401: - **Repoint.** Invoke `/doctor:memory`, `/doctor:causal-graph`, `/doctor:code-graph`, `/doctor:deep-loop`, `/doctor:cocoindex`, `/doctor:skill-advisor` and `/doctor:skill-budget` as `/doctor <target>`. For example, `/doctor:memory --dry-run` becomes `/doctor memory --dry-run`, and `/doctor:causal-graph --confidence-threshold=0.8` becomes `/doctor causal-graph --confidence-threshold=0.8`. Skill Advisor lexical routing handles old-form prompts through target trigger phrases in `_routes.yaml`.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/sk-git/feature-catalog/workflow-playbooks/doctor-git-settings.md:\n  Line 48: | `.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml` | Manifest | The three routes and their mutation classes |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:\n  Line 29: This playbook covers every `/doctor` command. Seventeen routers under `.skilled/commands/doctor/` each own a command: the router binds a target from `.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml`, loads that target's workflow YAML and renders through the command's presentation contract. A scenario tests what an operator sees when a target runs against a real repository: the plan a plan-first route prints, the table a report route renders, the refusal an unknown flag gets, and the state a writing route leaves behind.\n\n  Line 444: - Route manifest: `.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml`\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-git-standards-refuse-invalid.md:\n  Line 88: - Route manifest: [.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml](../../commands/doctor/_routes.yaml)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-skill-advisor-parent-skill.md:\n  Line 84: - Route manifest: [.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml](../../commands/doctor/_routes.yaml)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-git-hooks-list.md:\n  Line 87: - Route manifest: [.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml](../../commands/doctor/_routes.yaml)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-speckit-stale-index.md:\n  Line 89: - Route manifest: [.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml](../../commands/doctor/_routes.yaml)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-skill-advisor-skill-budget.md:\n  Line 79: - Route manifest: [.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml](../../commands/doctor/_routes.yaml)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-sk-skill-convert.md:\n  Line 145: - Route manifest: [.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes