ECKS` list in `git-setup-check.cjs`, which is the source of the battery order. A worktrees row whose result moves with the daemon counts points at `checkWorktrees` in the same file, because only the base location and the linked-worktree count may decide DEGRADED there. An unexpected FAIL is real setup drift, so run the printed repair and rerun the battery. A changed file or git config value is a defect in the battery and blocks release, because the route is declared read-only in `_routes.yaml`.\n\n  Line 92: - Route manifest: [.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml](../../commands/doctor/_routes.yaml)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-update-align.md:\n  Line 95: - Route manifest: [.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml](../../commands/doctor/_routes.yaml)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-update-check.md:\n  Line 94: - Route manifest: [.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml](../../commands/doctor/_routes.yaml)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-mcp-debug-fix.md:\n  Line 90: - Route manifest: [.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml](../../commands/doctor/_routes.yaml)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-git-standards-copy-once.md:\n  Line 89: - Route manifest: [.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml](../../commands/doctor/_routes.yaml)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-runtime-mirrors-in-sync.md:\n  Line 92: - Route manifest: [.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml](../../commands/doctor/_routes.yaml)\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skill