\\n36:       \\\"search does not find terms we know are indexed\\\",\\n37:       \\\"spec search is broken even for indexed terms\\\",\\n38:       \\\"our spec lookup finds nothing\\\",\\n39:       \\\"indexed terms are not found by spec search\\\"\\n40:     ],\\n41:     \\\"before\\\": \\\"Diagnose spec-kit retrieval: the generated trigger index, its lookup and the ripgrep recipes. trigger index drift. trigger index lookup fails. retrieval conventions doctor. ripgrep recipe check. citation drift summary. is the trigger index fresh\\\",\\n42:     \\\"after\\\": \\\"Diagnose spec-kit retrieval: the generated trigger index, its lookup and the ripgrep recipes. trigger index drift. trigger index lookup fails. retrieval conventions doctor. ripgrep recipe check. citation drift summary. is the trigger index fresh. spec search never finds anything. search does not find terms we know are indexed. spec search is broken even for indexed terms. our spec lookup finds nothing. indexed terms are not found by spec search\\\"\\n43:   },\\n44:   \\\"/doctor:update\\\": {\\n45:     \\\"source\\\": \\\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml\\\",\\n46:     \\\"typescriptEnabled\\\": true,\\n47:     \\\"typescriptId\\\": \\\"command-doctor-update\\\",\\n48:     \\\"added\\\": [\\n49:       \\\"is there a newer release of the toolkit\\\",\\n50:       \\\"what changed in the newer release\\\",\\n51:       \\\"are we on the latest release and what changed\\\",\\n52:       \\\"check whether a newer version exists and what changed\\\"\\n53:     ],\\n54:     \\\"before\\\": \\\"Route check, align, apply, rollback, record-base or compat operations for a spec-kit release. doctor update command. update skills to latest release. skilled release update. update skilled to the latest release. check for skilled updates. is there a newer skilled release. update my project to a newer skilled release. move my project to the newer spec-kit release\\\",\\n55:     \\\"after\\\": \\\"Route check, align, apply, rollback, record-base or compat operations for a spec-kit release. doctor update command. update skills to latest release. skilled release update. update skilled to the latest release. check for skilled updates. is there a newer skilled release. update my project to a newer skilled release. move my project to the newer spec-kit release. is there a newer release of the toolkit. what changed in the newer release. are we on the latest release and what changed. check whether a newer version exists and what changed\\\"\\n56:   },\\n57:   \\\"/speckit:search\\\": {\\n58:     \\\"source\\\": \\\".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/command-metadata.json\\\",\\n59:     \\\"typescriptEnabled\\\": true,\\n60:     \\\"typescriptId\\\": \\\"command-speckit-search\\\",\\n61:     \\\"added\\\": [\\n62:       \\\"look through our spec notes for anything mentioning\\\",\\n63:       \\\"search our spec notes for a topic\\\",\\n64:       \\\"find spec notes that mention a term\\\",\\n65:       \\\"which spec notes mention rate limiting\\\"\\n66:     ],\\n67:     \\\"before\\\": \\\"I want to find which spec packet or skill doc already covers what I am asking about. find the spec packet. which spec covers this. which packets mention. search the spec docs. is this already documented\\\",\\n68:     \\\"after\\\": \\\"I want to find which spec packet or skill doc already covers what I am asking about. find the spec packet. which spec covers this. which packets mention. search the spec docs. is this already documented. look through our spec notes for anything mentioning. search our spec notes for a topic. find spec notes that mention a term. which spec notes mention rate limiting\\\"\\n69:   },\\n70:   \\\"/create:skill-parent\\\": {\\n71:     \\\"source\\\": \\\".skilled/skills/sk-doc/command-metadata.json\\\",\\n72:     \\\"typescriptEnabled\\\": false,\\n73:     \\\"typescriptId\\\": null,\\n74:     \\\"added\\\": [\\n75:       \\\"hub skill that holds several nested workflow variants\\\"