ine's `STATUS=FINDINGS rows=12 findings=2 unknown=0` line and the exit code.\n\n  Line 98: - The two repairs written beside A10 and A11.\n\n  Line 102: - **Pass**: Both runs report the twelve rows in order with their own statuses, A1 names the state the repository is in and `adopted` for the fixture, each route status matches its engine's exit code, A10 and A11 are quoted in full with one repair each, no `UNKNOWN` row is presented as a pass, and every counted value is unchanged.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"limit\": 30, \"path\": \".skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-agents-md-check.md\", \"pattern\": \"A11|malformed|wrong width\"}"},"time":{"start":1794670204372,"end":1794670205314}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794670205391,"sessionID":"ses_e255ff46effe7EWyuOLOEwVdy1","part":{"partID":"prt_1daae1767001tbY6k0oevINA7q","sessionID":"ses_e255ff46effe7EWyuOLOEwVdy1","messageID":"msg_1daad8121001KFH9P7zfy7MW2h","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-91f0c947faa22889","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"git log -1 --format=%B 4e9586b2be","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"fix(doctor): name malformed router rows in the detail line\n\nThe agents-md check marked REPO RULES.md as a finding when a table row had\nthe wrong width, while its detail still read \"0 shipped row(s) missing\"\nand the reader had to open the row lines to learn why. The detail now\ncarries the malformed row count beside the missing count. The existing\nmalformed-row test asserts the new detail and failed before the change.\n\nThe OpenCode plugin's compiled-route line renderer has no production\ncaller since the brief was tightened. Its comment now says so, because it\nstill read as if the line reached a session.\n\nCommit-Id: 0013938\n\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"fix(doctor): name malformed router rows in the detail line\n\nThe agents-md check marked REPO RULES.md as a finding when a table row had\nthe wrong width, while its detail still read \"0 shipped row(s) missing\"\nand the reader had to open the row lines to learn why. The detail now\ncarries the malformed row count beside the missing count. The existing\nmalformed-row test asserts the new detail and failed before the change.\n\nThe OpenCode plugin's compiled-route line renderer has no production\ncaller since the brief was tightened. Its comment now says so, because it\nstill read as if the line reached a session.\n\nCommit-Id: 0013938\n\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"git