ing-build/014-review-remediation/plan.md:\n  Line 86: | `agents-md-check.cjs` A10 and A11 | Reports runtime copies and router rows | update | T024 to T027 cases, this repository's `STATUS=OK` |\n\n  Line 117: | Unit | One failing-then-passing case per finding: the embed write fault, restore, link and foreign cases, the attach guards, the renderer heads, the env allowlist, the arena check, the g2 labels, the A10 and A11 cases, the hook checks, the Devin fallback, the DSH pin, the parity tests and the output cap | `node --test` for the doctor scripts and readers, Vitest for the advisor runtime |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install/review-report.md:\n  Line 57:     \"agents-md-check.cjs A10 and A11\",\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-install-2/deep-review-dashboard.md:\n  Line 120: - iteration 2 malformed_router_row (ruled_out): malformed rows are kept and reported; evidence=.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs:824\n\n  Line 145: - iteration 2 malformed_router_row (ruled_out): malformed rows are kept and reported; evidence=.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs:824\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/014-review-remediation/tasks.md:\n  Line 115: - [x] T027 Report a router row of the wrong width as malformed (`CHK`, `CHKT`). Test first: in `CHKT`, add a case whose `REPO RULES.md` is a complete router with one trigger row's last cell holding `a | b`: expect A11 to print `malformed trigger row at line <n>: 4 cells where the header has 3`, no `missing` line for that row's rule and state `FINDING`. Today A11 prints `missing trigger row for` tha