bench matrix and the READMEs and catalog pages that describe them. The recaptured baseline publishes no per-row outcome for a holdout row.\n\n  Line 77: | `DS/agents-md-check.cjs`, `DS/tests/agents-md-check.test.cjs`, `DS/README.markdown` | Modified | A10 link and pointer reports, A11 malformed rows and four child checks |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"include\": \"*.md\", \"limit\": 40, \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\", \"pattern\": \"malformed row|malformed router|A11\"}"},"time":{"start":1794670204204,"end":1794670205412}}}}
