onstant matches the line verbatim.\\\", \\\"evidenceRefs\\\": [\\\"spec-gate-core.mjs:154\\\"]},\\n        {\\\"method\\\": \\\"direct_read\\\", \\\"queryOrPath\\\": \\\"gate-3-menu-parity.test.mjs:20-57\\\", \\\"result\\\": \\\"the presentation is in the parity file list; no runtime branch exists.\\\", \\\"evidenceRefs\\\": [\\\"gate-3-menu-parity.test.mjs:26\\\"]}\\n      ],\\n      \\\"disposition\\\": \\\"ruled_out\\\",\\n      \\\"ruledOutReason\\\": \\\"The line is plain text read by every runtime and matches the single canonical constant; the parity guard covers it.\\\",\\n      \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"No cross-runtime divergence.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"SL-005\\\",\\n      \\\"dimension\\\": \\\"correctness\\\",\\n      \\\"targetRefs\\\": [\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml:396-406,797-806\\\"],\\n      \\\"bugClass\\\": \\\"derived_data_sync\\\",\\n      \\\"hypothesis\\\": \\\"The removed phrases may still live in the derived bridge data or the Python markers.\\\",\\n      \\\"searchActions\\\": [\\n        {\\\"method\\\": \\\"exact_search\\\", \\\"queryOrPath\\\": \\\"command-bridges.generated.json for each removed phrase\\\", \\\"result\\\": \\\"all six queries returned false.\\\", \\\"evidenceRefs\\\": [\\\"command-bridges.generated.json\\\"]},\\n        {\\\"method\\\": \\\"exact_search\\\", \\\"queryOrPath\\\": \\\"repo-wide rg excluding specs, changelogs and both prompt corpora\\\", \\\"result\\\": \\\"no tracked source hit outside the test that names a near-match.\\\", \\\"evidenceRefs\\\": [\\\"doctor-helper-handoff.vitest.ts:118-128\\\"]}\\n      ],\\n      \\\"disposition\\\": \\\"ruled_out\\\",\\n      \\\"ruledOutReason\\\": \\\"The deriver was rerun and the generated data no longer carries any removed phrase.\\\",\\n      \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"The source and derived surfaces agree.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"SL-006\\\",\\n      \\\"dimension\\\": \\\"security\\\",\\n      \\\"targetRefs\\\": [\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml:396-406,797-806\\\"],\\n      \\\"bugClass\\\": \\\"holdout_leakage\\\",\\n      \\\"hypothesis\\\": \\\"Reviewing the changed route phrases may read or print a holdout prompt.\\\",\\n      \\\"searchActions\\\": [\\n        {\\\"method\\\": \\\"exact_search\\\", \\\"queryOrPath\\\": \\\"rg with --glob '!**/command-prompts.jsonl' --glob '!**/holdout-prompts.jsonl'\\\", \\\"result\\\": \\\"no prompt corpus was opened; only a tune row already materialized in a scratch artifact was seen.\\\", \\\"evidenceRefs\\\": [\\\"review-brief-4.txt:1\\\"]}\\n      ],\\n      \\\"disposition\\\": \\\"ruled_out\\\",\\n      \\\"ruledOutReason\\\": \\\"No command-prompts.jsonl or holdout-prompts.jsonl read occurred; the search excluded both files.\\\",\\n      \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Holdout hygiene held.\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"SL-007\\\",\\n      \\\"dimension\\\": \\\"correctness\\\",\\n      \\\"targetRefs\\\": [\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs\\\"],\\n      \\\"bugClass\\\": \\\"phantom_scorer_count\\\",\\n      \\\"hypothesis\\\": \\\"The changed files may make the transcript scorer count a load, step or offer that did not happen.\\\",\\n      \\\"searchActions\\\": [\\n        {\\\"method\\\": \\\"direct_read\\\", \\\"queryOrPath\\\": \\\"the four changed files\\\", \\\"result\\\": \\\"none contains transcript-scoring code; the only scorer-facing change is the manifest-to-bridge data.\\\", \\\"evidenceRefs\\\": [\\\"review-scope-4.txt:6-9\\\"]}\\n      ],\\n      \\\"disposition\\\": \\\"not_applicable\\\",\\n      \\\"notApplicableReason\\\": \\\"The doctor-docs area has no transcript-scoring code; the scorer paths belong to the accuracy-runner and scorer-attach areas.\\\",\\n      \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Out of this area's scope.\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"graphEvents\\\": [\\n    {\\\"type\\\": \\\"node\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"file:doctor-agents-md-presentation\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"FILE\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"doctor agents-md presentation\\\"},\\n    {\\\"type\\\": \\\"node\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"file:agents-md-check\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"FILE\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"agents-md check engine\\\"},\\n    {\\\"type\\\": \\\"node\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"finding:DR4-P2-001\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"FINDING\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"A11 malformed repair gap\\\"},\\n    {\\\"type\\\": \\\"node\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"evidence:embed-router-repair\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"EVIDENCE\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"embed addRouterRows:794\\\"},\\n    {\\\"type\\\": \\\"edge\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"edge:finding-presentation\\\", \\\"source\\\": \\\"finding:DR4-P2-001\\\", \\\"target\\\": \\\"file:doctor-agents-md-presentation\\\", \\\"relation\\\": \\\"IN_FILE\\\"},\\n    {\\\"type\\\": \\\"edge\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"edge:finding-check\\\", \\\"source\\\": \\\"finding:DR4-P2-001\\\", \\\"target\\\": \\\"file:agents-md-check\\\", \\\"relation\\\": \\\"IN_FILE\\\"},\\n    {\\\"type\\\": \\\"edge\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"edge:evidence-finding\\\", \\\"source\\\": \\\"evidence:embed-router-repair\\\", \\\"target\\\": \\\"finding:DR4-P2-001\\\", \\\"relation\\\": \\\"EVIDENCE_FOR\\\"}\\n  ]\\n}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/doctor-docs-4/prompts/iteration-001.record.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1794670505543,"end":1794670552569}}}}
