{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794670873280,"sessionID":"ses_e255ff46effe7EWyuOLOEwVdy1","part":{"partID":"prt_1dab83fb2001DkfI1aHkCrTIfu","sessionID":"ses_e255ff46effe7EWyuOLOEwVdy1","messageID":"msg_1dab7ec79001dSsBNmcN7pJ6ye","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-ae3b328dfc73399b","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"git log -1 --format=%B a494145dd0","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"fix(system-skill-advisor): read a typed mode suffix and keep doctor phrases in their domain\n\nA command typed with its mode suffix, such as /deep:review:auto, reached the\nmodel with no command, because the colon read as more of the name. The three\ndocumented suffixes now end the command name.\n\nThe doctor problem cue spelled its contractions with a straight apostrophe, so\na prompt typed with a curly one got no doctor helper. The cue now folds it.\n\nSix doctor route phrases built from everyday repair and release words are\nremoved. The doctor matcher ranks on shared words, so they pulled a request to\nfix failing tests onto /doctor:setup and a release notes request onto\n/doctor:update. The floors, the eval numbers and the real-embedder holdout count\nare unchanged.\n\nCommit-Id: 0013924\n\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"fix(system-skill-advisor): read a typed mode suffix and keep doctor phrases in their domain\n\nA command typed with its mode suffix, such as /deep:review:auto, reached the\nmodel with no command, because the colon read as more of the name. The three\ndocumented suffixes now end the command name.\n\nThe doctor problem cue spelled its contractions with a straight apostrophe, so\na prompt typed with a curly one got no doctor helper. The cue now folds it.\n\nSix doctor route phrases built from everyday repair and release words are\nremoved. The doctor matcher ranks on shared words, so they pulled a request to\nfix failing tests onto /doctor:setup and a release notes request onto\n/doctor:update. The floors, the eval numbers and the real-embedder holdout count\nare unchanged.\n\nCommit-Id: 0013924\n\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"git log -1 --format=%B a494145dd0\", \"workdir\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794670870450,"end":1794670873280}}}}
