and DSH, and absent by design on Devin; no old-name command file remains.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"protocolId\": \"feature_catalog_code\",\n        \"status\": \"pass\",\n        \"gateClass\": \"advisory\",\n        \"applicable\": true,\n        \"counts\": {\"pass\": 1, \"partial\": 0, \"fail\": 0, \"skipped\": 0},\n        \"evidence\": [\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/scorer-fusion/doctor-command-routing.md:27-39\"],\n        \"findingRefs\": [],\n        \"summary\": \"The catalog's gating, readOnly and three-word reach claims match the generated policies and the deriver.\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"protocolId\": \"playbook_capability\",\n        \"status\": \"partial\",\n        \"gateClass\": \"advisory\",\n        \"applicable\": true,\n        \"counts\": {\"pass\": 0, \"partial\": 1, \"fail\": 0, \"skipped\": 0},\n        \"evidence\": [\".skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-agents-md-check.md:30\", \".skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-agents-md-check.md:102\", \".skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-setup-run.md:28-36\", \".skilled/manual-testing-playbook/doctor-commands/doctor-update-check.md:23-29\"],\n        \"findingRefs\": [\"DR4-P2-001\"],\n        \"summary\": \"The carried A11 repair gap remains; the setup and update playbooks use typed commands and do not quote the removed phrases.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"newFindingsRatio\": 0.0,\n  \"sessionId\": \"fanout-doctor-docs-4-1794669272137-9v23rz\",\n  \"generation\": 1,\n  \"lineageMode\": \"new\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-11-14T15:45:37Z\",\n  \"durationMs\": 300000,\n  \"reviewDepthSchemaVersion\": 2,\n  \"reviewDepthApplicability\": {\n    \"scopeClass\": \"standard\",\n    \"enforcement\": \"warn\",\n    \"reason\": \"The attach policy and spec traceability span the route manifest, the generated bridge data, the attach guard, the feature catalog and two playbooks.\",\n    \"evidenceRefs\": [\".skille